<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Dear {!IndividualApplication.COE_Approver__c},</p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></font><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">This is to inform you that the application titled&nbsp;</font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">“</b><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">”</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;from the&nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><b>{!Account.BillingState}</b></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">WIN-COE</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;has been successfully&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">submitted</b><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;to the&nbsp;</span>{!IndividualApplication.Account}<span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;on&nbsp;</span><b>{!IndividualApplication.AppliedDate}</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">.</span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please ensure all supporting documents and institutional endorsements have been uploaded as required. Should any additional details be needed, our team will reach out accordingly.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">We appreciate your prompt coordination and continued engagement in driving impactful initiatives.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,<br><b>Wadhwani Foundation</b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>]]></td>
